
# Pred použitím:
# 1. Spusti AppHost
# 2. Skopiruj URL WebApi z Aspire dashboardu do @webApiUrl
# 3. Skopiruj URL DbManager z Aspire dashboardu do @dbManagerUrl

@webApiUrl = https://localhost:7107
@dbManagerUrl = https://localhost:7076

# @noRejectUnauthorized



# Db
# --------------------------------

### Reset databazy (zmaze vsetko a vlozia sa testovacie data)
POST {{dbManagerUrl}}/reset-db


# Meals
# --------------------------------

### Zobraz vsetky jedla
GET {{webApiUrl}}/api/meals

### Zobraz jedno jedlo (zmen id)
GET {{webApiUrl}}/api/meals/1

### Vytvor nove jedlo
POST {{webApiUrl}}/api/meals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Beef in cream sauce",
  "price": 145
}

### Uprav jedlo (zmen id)
PUT {{webApiUrl}}/api/meals/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Beef in cream sauce",
  "price": 150,
  "isActive": true
}

### Deaktivuj jedlo (isActive = false)
PUT {{webApiUrl}}/api/meals/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Beef in cream sauce",
  "price": 150,
  "isActive": false
}


# Menu
# --------------------------------

### Zobraz vsetky polozky menu (vsetky dni)
GET {{webApiUrl}}/api/menu

### Zobraz iba dnesne menu
GET {{webApiUrl}}/api/menu/today

### Vytvor novu polozku menu na dnes (mealId musi existovat v jedlach)
POST {{webApiUrl}}/api/menu
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-04-02",
  "availablePortions": 10,
  "mealId": 1
}

### Uprav polozku menu (zmen id)
PUT {{webApiUrl}}/api/menu/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-04-02",
  "availablePortions": 5
}

### Zmaz polozku menu (zmen id)
DELETE {{webApiUrl}}/api/menu/1


# OBJEDNAVKY (Orders)
# --------------------------------

### Zobraz vsetky objednavky
GET {{webApiUrl}}/api/orders

### Vytvor objednavku (menuItemId musi existovat v menu)
POST {{webApiUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "menuItemId": 1
}

### Zmen stav na Ready (hotova)
PUT {{webApiUrl}}/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Ready"
}

### Zmen stav na Cancelled (zrusena)
PUT {{webApiUrl}}/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Cancelled"
}

### Zmen stav na Completed (dokoncena / vydana)
PUT {{webApiUrl}}/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Completed"
}


# Tests
# --------------------------------

### Objednaj z vypredaneho jedla (ocakavany 400)
POST {{webApiUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "menuItemId": 3
}

### Neplatny prechod stavu (ocakavany 400)
PUT {{webApiUrl}}/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Completed"
}

### Jedlo ktore neexistuje (ocakavany 404)
GET {{webApiUrl}}/api/meals/999
